@host = http://localhost:3001

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### List campaigns (paginated, filtered, sorted)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns?limit=5&status=active&sort=visitors&order=desc

### Get one
GET {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/camp-001

### Create
# @name create
POST {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Spring Sale",
  "status": "active",
  "channel": "Web",
  "conversionRate": 5.2,
  "visitors": 1000,
  "startDate": "2026-04-01"
}

### Update (uses the id returned by the create request above)
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{create.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "paused"
}

### Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/campaigns/{{create.response.body.id}}

### OpenAPI spec
GET {{host}}/api/openapi.json
